-\int\frac{d\epsilon}{\pi}\frac{d\nu}{\pi}\frac{d\mu}{\pi}\frac{dz}{\pi}B\left(\boldsymbol{k}-\boldsymbol{k}'-\boldsymbol{p},z\right)C\left(\boldsymbol{p},\mu\right)A\left(\boldsymbol{k},\nu\right)A\left(\boldsymbol{k}'+\boldsymbol{q},\epsilon\right)\left[n_{B}\left(-z\right)-n_{B}\left(\mu\right)\right]\left[n_{B}\left(z+\mu\right)+n_{F}\left(\nu\right)\right]\left(\frac{n_{F}\left(\epsilon-i\omega_{n}\right)-n_{F}\left(\nu-z-\mu\right)}{\epsilon-i\omega_{n}+z+\mu-\nu}\right)\\
-\int\frac{d\epsilon}{\pi}\frac{d\nu}{\pi}\frac{d\mu}{\pi}\frac{dz}{\pi}B\left(\boldsymbol{k}-\boldsymbol{k}'-\boldsymbol{p},z\right)C\left(\boldsymbol{p},\mu\right)A\left(\boldsymbol{k},\nu\right)A\left(\boldsymbol{k}'+\boldsymbol{q},\epsilon\right)\left[n_{B}\left(-z\right)-n_{B}\left(\mu\right)\right]\left[n_{B}\left(z+\mu\right)+n_{F}\left(\nu\right)\right]\left(\frac{n_{F}\left(\epsilon\right)-n_{F}\left(\nu-z-\mu\right)}{\epsilon-i\omega_{n}+z+\mu-\nu}\right)\\
\int\frac{d\epsilon}{\pi}\frac{d\nu}{\pi}\frac{d\mu}{\pi}\frac{dz}{\pi}B\left(\boldsymbol{k}-\boldsymbol{k}'-\boldsymbol{p},z\right)C\left(\boldsymbol{p},\mu\right)A\left(\boldsymbol{k},\nu\right)A\left(\boldsymbol{k}'+\boldsymbol{q},\epsilon\right)\left[n_{B}\left(-z\right)-n_{B}\left(\mu\right)\right]\left[n_{B}\left(z+\mu\right)+n_{F}\left(\nu\right)\right]\left(\frac{n_{F}\left(\epsilon\right)-n_{F}\left(\nu-z-\mu\right)}{i\omega_{n}-\epsilon-z-\mu+\nu}\right)
